%[text] %[text:anchor:H_8415D9AA] ## Further Exploration
%[text] Consider what happens in a multi-step reaction, such as the [Ostwald](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wilhelm_Ostwald) process for nitric acid production:
%[text]{"align":"center"} $4 \\text{NH}\_2 + 5 \\text{O}\_2 \\rightarrow 4 \\text{NO} + 6 \\text{H}\_2\\text{O}${"altText":"4 NH\_2 + 5 O\_2 yields 4 NO + 6 H\_2O"}
%[text]{"align":"center"} $2\\text{NO} + \\text{O}\_2 \\rightarrow 2\\text{NO}\_2${"altText":"2NO + O\_2 yields 2NO\_2"} 
%[text]{"align":"center"} $3\\text{NO}\_2 + \\text{H}\_2\\text{O} \\rightarrow 2\\text{HNO}\_3 + \\text{NO}${"altText":"3NO\_2 + H\_2O yields 2HNO\_3 + NO"}
